      "text": "OD:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " up to 20 mg/kg elemental Fe = ⍉toxic; > 60 mg/kg can cause severe toxicity. Severe toxicity (met acidosis, shock, severe gastroenteritis or serum Fe > 500 mcg/dL): IV deferoxamine, w IV hydration. Radiopaque tablets on XR: whole-bowel irrigation; activated charcoal doesn't adsorb Fe."
     }
